刚刚开始。","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/cfcoeuamghif7uj5bhrl4manz0spc35.mp3","text":"这么安静——你不担心错过外面的好戏吗？","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/dbyvdxrg2810iv6rsaqp9lkkmoncco3.mp3","text":"哈哈......你也是这么和德克萨斯打招呼的？","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/0f87w054qqp7a371cvjwwfudmga8duu.mp3","text":"来来来，与狼共舞。","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/bqeedifbqifyc7h8pkp49q0864btvpc.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/q0yz2bujswwz257oyrcu6ha32ulys8o.mp3","text":"新年快乐。你想邀请我进去吗？你要怎么介绍我？德克萨斯的死敌，萨卢佐家的叛徒，还是想要征服一切的白狼？享受今天吧，博士。过了今晚，双月依然只为狩猎而升。","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/8faxnpmjb07bi3n1f2775bvg22nsird.mp3","text":"我这里有一套狂欢节的礼服，换上它。","alt":"voice/char_1038_whitw2/cn_042.mp3"}]}}